<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Terra lowered by Merrill.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Terra lowered by Merrill.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it lowered its intermediate-term rating on Terra Industries Inc to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 3/4 at 14.</p>
